⬇️FULL RECIPE⬇️
273 calories 23g protein (for the entire pint, mix-ins included)

Peppermint Bark Protein Blizzard 😋🍦
- 400g Fat Free Fairlife Milk
- 40g Monk Fruit Sweetener (or any sugar substitute)
- 2.5g (½ tsp) vanilla bean paste (or extract)
- ⅛ tsp peppermint extract
- A pinch of salt
- 1g (¼ tsp) xanthan gum
Mix-ins:
- 2 Peppermint Bark chocolate squares, chopped (140 calories)
272 cal 24g C, 9g F, 23g P

Instructions:
1. Blend all ingredients for the base and freeze (at least 16 hours)
2. Run your pint under hot water for at least 60 seconds
3. Spin on “Lite Ice Cream” setting 
4. Spin on “Respin” setting (if necessary)
5. Make a hole down to the bottom with a butter knife and fill with the chopped Peppermint Bark
6. Run the “Mix-in” cycle

